Weight-space transfer of a neural quantum state
Copyright 2026 Paul Gauthier

This repository contains a re-implementation of, and weights derived from, the Vision Transformer neural
quantum state released by Riccardo Rende, Luciano Loris Viteritti et al. under the Apache License 2.0
(https://huggingface.co/nqs-models/j1j2_square_10x10_05):

  wsp/vit.py re-implements the released Flax model code (transformer.py, attentions.py) in plain JAX.
  weights/*_params.npz are that network's revision "main" weights, edited by wsp/transfer.py and then
  fine-tuned on 12x12 to 18x18 lattices.

The released weights themselves are not redistributed here; scripts/download_base.py fetches them.
